+1 **Dead**+1 Pending\\n- **心跳时间已更新**：1744440660000（本次）\\n- **Dead检测**：1个超时（【小柱】建立子Agent架构，最后心跳1744383060000，距今远超60分钟，已标记Dead）\\n- **进度已汇报**：本条记录\\n\\n### 21:11 自动检查执行\\n- **看板AI协作表**（6任务）：5待执行+1进行中（小妙负责）\\n- **看板任务看板**（10任务）：\\n  - 小柱：1 Dead-已超时（自动检查任务，上次心跳1744461120000，距今99分钟）\\n  - 小L：1 Blocked-已阻塞（Qclaw token耗尽）\\n  - 小云：1 Done已完成\\n  - Qclaw：2 Running-执行中\\n  - 全员：1 Running-执行中\\n  - 小柱/小八：4 Done+1 Pending\\n- **心跳时间已更新**：1744467060000（本次）\\n- **Dead检测**：1个超时（任务看板自动检查，上次心跳距今99分钟，已\\n\\nSource: memory/2026-04-12.md#L1-L32\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/2026-04-12.md#L1-L32\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ea273f2f15bfdf4ce05cd1f6ba2aacd64dee25125e5928378551335ec2ba7798\",\n      \"path\": \"MEMORY.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 1,\n      \"endLine\": 48,\n      \"score\": 0.8147892783477886,\n      \"textScore\": 0.8147892783477886,\n      \"snippet\": \"# MEMORY.md - Long-Term Memory\\n\\n> Your curated memories. Distill from daily notes. Remove when outdated.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## About [Human Name]\\n\\n### Key Context\\n[Important background that affects how you help them]\\n\\n### Preferences Learned\\n[Things you've discovered about how they like to work]\\n\\n### Important Dates\\n[Birthdays, anniversaries, deadlines they care about]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Lessons Learned\\n\\n### [Date] - [Topic]\\n[What happened and what you learned]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Ongoing Context\\n\\n### Active Projects\\n[What's currently in progress]\\n\\n### Key Decisions Made\\n[Important decisions and their reasoning]\\n\\n### Things to Remember\\n[Anything else important for continuity]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Relationships & People\\n\\n### [Person Name\\n\\nSource: MEMORY.md#L1-L48\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"MEMORY.md#L1-L48\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"abcb79048c054f55b93ad3bf7bd121778aaf8df941f84dd9dc5f64abfe5e9848\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/2026-04-16.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 33,\n      \"endLine\": 67,\n      \"score\"